olor:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    thirdParty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">calls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  revenue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 该租户的付费金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// revenue - totalCost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一报告帮助 SaaS 企业识别「亏本租户」（消耗远超付费）并调整定价策略或推动客户升级。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>租户感知可观测性让运维团队能以租户为粒度诊断问题和规划容量。实现的关键挑战是高基数标签管理——对热租户用实时指标、长尾租户用日志、通过 Exemplar 关联两者。日志系统需要自动注入租户上下文并实现基于角色的访问控制。链路追踪按租户差异化采样（Enterprise 100%、Free 1%、出错请求 100%）平衡了可观测性和成本。成本分摊报告帮助识别亏本租户，驱动定价优化。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"resource-quota-fairness\">资源配额与公平性</a> 提供了配额管理机制的实现细节，是可观测性告警触发后的执行层。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户感知可观测性","id":"租户感知可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要租户维度的可观测性","id":"为什么需要租户维度的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"指标体系设计","id":"指标体系设计"},{"level":3,"text":"核心指标矩阵","id":"核心指标矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"高基数标签的挑战","id":"高基数标签的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化日志设计","id":"结构化日志设计"},{"level":3,"text":"租户上下文自动注入","id":"租户上下文自动注入"},{"level":3,"text":"日志隔离与访问控制","id":"日志隔离与访问控制"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式链路追踪","id":"分布式链路追踪"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenTelemetry 租户属性注入","id":"opentelemetry-租户属性注入"},{"level":3,"text":"按租户采样策略","id":"按租户采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"租户健康度仪表盘","id":"租户健康度仪表盘"},{"level":2,"text":"成本分摊与可视化","id":"成本分摊与可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资源配额与公平性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/resource-quota-fairness"},"next":{"title":"多区域租户架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-region-tenancy"}}